3. Boundary-Aware Loss Function (FIXED shape compatibility)
4. Advanced Medical Augmentation
5. Comprehensive Regularization
6. Learning Rate Warmup + Cosine Decay
7. Gradient Clipping
8. Deep Supervision (temporarily disabled for stability)
"""

